<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-16T14:57:29.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:57:29 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi missiles have struck Yemen's presidential palace in Aden, killing five officials, and have also hit a Saudi airport. Iran has boosted its air defenses and is shipping LPG and jet fuel despite a US blockade, while also sinking two container ships near the Strait of Hormuz, expanding the threat to regional shipping. US officials are reportedly considering the use of the &amp;quot;mother of all bombs&amp;quot; if fighting resumes, and Trump has ruled out using a nuclear bomb on Iran. The conflict recorded 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm62y6lp73zdo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261016-us-considers-hitting-iran-with-mother-of-all-bombs&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/16/future-western-security-at-stake-yemen-civil-war-former-pm&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/15/azerbaijan-engineers-rare-summit-with-in-conflict-middle-east-and-asian-leaders&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/14/business/economy/gas-prices-inflation-cpi.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/14/world/middleeast/houthi-airport-attack-victims-saudi-arabia.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOWTZpcFVJTkM3bUtsS2ZkY1RoQ0ZLTFFQeHhBUzltcV9ZZzR6WTJsNWpDcXRHdFA0UENlTmVvcEtSZWVPMjZDTHNvSlc3bmRFUnJ3NGtPb1hwUFVwUzFzc1Fkcm1MV0prTGxjQjRaWEotV2Vud2RKTmJSYjVPaXVHN2JXMHdFYXJXTnJBd3FhNkZmZEdhMGNOVHBSZVpKTTVuSktPNFhzNWRDelpIMlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/arti